{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"風が気持ちの良い季節に\nなってきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/03/4309075/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなニット暑苦しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかの私服"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/03/4309075/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これもちょっと暑苦しい？\nあれ？これ、載せたっけ、あれ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前、\nお父さんが炊き込みご飯を\n作ってくれました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おじいちゃんが採ってきた筍！\n家の竹やぶにはえてたんだって！\nおじいちゃんはいつも新鮮な野菜を\nお家に届けてくれます。\n野菜美味しいの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤家は普段、炊き込みご飯を\n作らないので感動しちゃった〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだもおにぎりにして\n撮影場に持って行きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/03/4309075/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また作ってほしい\nって頼んだら今から作るって笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やったー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月刊エンタメ載ってます！\n堀未央奈×伊藤万理華\nペアグラビア"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見たらなるほど、ってなるかなあ\nしっくりきてるかしら！\n楽しんでました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/03/4309075/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"取材でもあるように\n撮影中ずっとボケてました。\n毎回そうです、\nもちろん一人か二人くらい\nじゃないとできないけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうしてないと落ち着かないみたい。\n笑わせるの好きなのかな、、？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"載せられる写真って\n全部綺麗に撮ってもらったもの\nばかりだから載せられないのが残念。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、バレッタのナタリーグラビアでは\nふざけてるところも載ってる！\n本当にいつもあんな感じよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも綺麗に撮ってもらえるって幸せ。\nやっぱり撮影は楽しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/03/4309075/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにヒール高かったの。\nガニ股で歩いてたら\nスタッフさんに笑われた笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月9日はBOMB発売！\n日芽香と飛鳥と私の3人です。\nこちらもよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その前にアンダーライブ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドキドキが止まらねえ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/03/4309075/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おれ、がんばる！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}